<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ParkPulse HK · 泊快充 3D — 手機使用教學</title>
<meta name="description" content="ParkPulse HK（泊快充 3D）手機版使用教學：底欄分頁、GPS、地圖 FAB、設施詳情與設定。">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #020617; --bg-elev: #0b1224; --bg-card: #0f172a;
    --line: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18); --text: #f8fafc; --muted: #94a3b8;
    --cyan: #22d3ee; --cyan-dim: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14);
    --emerald: #34d399; --emerald-dim: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.14);
    --radius: 16px;
    --font: "Noto Sans TC", "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang HK", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft JhengHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0; font-family: var(--font); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 10% -10%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12), transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 90% 0%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.10), transparent 45%),
      var(--bg);
  }
  a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  .top { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; backdrop-filter: blur(14px); background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.82); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .top-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 56px; gap: 12px; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
  .brand:hover { text-decoration: none; }
  .brand-mark { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--emerald)); display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #020617; }
  .brand small { display: block; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 1px; }
  .lang-toggle { display: inline-flex; padding: 3px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bg-elev); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .lang-toggle button { appearance: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: var(--muted); }
  .lang-toggle button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--cyan-dim); color: var(--cyan); }
  .sc { display: none; }
  html.lang-sc .tc { display: none; }
  html.lang-sc .sc { display: inline; }
  html.lang-sc h1.sc, html.lang-sc h2.sc, html.lang-sc p.sc.block, html.lang-sc .sc.block { display: block; }
  .hero { padding: 48px 0 28px; }
  .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--emerald); background: var(--emerald-dim); border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.35); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; }
  .eyebrow .dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--emerald); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--emerald); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.4rem); line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 16px 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .lead strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .chip { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--cyan); background: var(--cyan-dim); border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.28); border-radius: 8px; padding: 4px 10px; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06b6d4, #10b981); color: #020617; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.22); text-decoration: none; border: 0; }
  .btn:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); text-decoration: none; }
  section { padding: 28px 0; }
  .sec-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .sec-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .sec-num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cyan); background: var(--cyan-dim); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 8px; }
  .card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px 22px; }
  .card p { margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted); }
  .card strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .card ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted); }
  .card li { margin: 4px 0; }
  .card li strong { color: var(--text); }
  .note { margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px 14px; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.28); border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #fcd34d; }
  .kbd { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; background: var(--bg-elev); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1px 7px; color: var(--cyan); white-space: nowrap; }
  .pill-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .pill { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bg-elev); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text); }
  .disclaimer { background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.25); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .footer-cta { text-align: center; padding: 40px 0 56px; }
  .footer-cta h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .footer-cta p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 20px; }
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 18px 0 28px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  footer .wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; justify-content: space-between; }
  .shot { margin: 16px 0 0; }
  .shot .fr { position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%; }
  .shot img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35); border-radius: 12px; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .shot .mk { position: absolute; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff3b5c; color: #fff; font: 700 12px/22px system-ui, sans-serif; text-align: center; border: 2px solid #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,229,255,.55); pointer-events: none; }
  .shot.tall .fr { max-width: 380px; }
  .shot ol { margin: 10px 0 0; padding-left: 22px; font-size: .92em; color: var(--muted); }
  .shot ol li { margin: 3px 0; }
  .shot ol .tc, .shot ol .sc { color: var(--text); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap top-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="https://parkpulsehk.web.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span class="brand-mark">P</span>
      <span>ParkPulse HK<small class="tc">泊快充 3D · 手機使用教學</small><small class="sc">泊快充 3D · 手机使用教学</small></span>
    </a>
    <div class="lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Language">
      <button type="button" id="btn-tc" aria-pressed="true">繁</button>
      <button type="button" id="btn-sc" aria-pressed="false">简</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <div class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>
      <span class="tc">手機版優先 · parkpulsehk.web.app</span>
      <span class="sc">手机版优先 · parkpulsehk.web.app</span>
    </span>
    <h1 class="tc">ParkPulse 手機點用？</h1>
    <h1 class="sc block">ParkPulse 手机怎么用？</h1>
    <p class="lead tc">
      <strong>ParkPulse HK · 泊快充 3D</strong> 喺手機瀏覽器顯示<strong>地圖 + 底欄</strong>：揀意圖分頁、睇 2KM 內車場／咪錶／充電，再打開詳情去 Google Maps。無需登入。App 內語系：<span class="kbd">繁</span>／<span class="kbd">简</span>／<span class="kbd">EN</span>（預設 zh-HK）。
    </p>
    <p class="lead sc block">
      <strong>ParkPulse HK · 泊快充 3D</strong> 在手机浏览器显示<strong>地图 + 底栏</strong>：选意图分页、看 2KM 内车场／咪表／充电，再打开详情去 Google Maps。无需登录。App 内语系：<span class="kbd">繁</span>／<span class="kbd">简</span>／<span class="kbd">EN</span>（默认 zh-HK）。
    </p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip tc">手機底欄</span><span class="chip sc">手机底栏</span>
      <span class="chip tc">停車場 · 咪錶 · EV</span><span class="chip sc">停车场 · 咪表 · EV</span>
      <span class="chip">GPS</span>
      <span class="chip">data.gov.hk</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn" href="https://parkpulsehk.web.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="tc">立即試用 ParkPulse</span>
        <span class="sc">立即试用 ParkPulse</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="open">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">01</span>
      <h2 class="tc">打開應用（手機主畫面）</h2>
      <h2 class="sc">打开应用（手机主画面）</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="tc">用手機瀏覽器開啟：
        <a href="https://parkpulsehk.web.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://parkpulsehk.web.app/</a>
      </p>
      <p class="sc block">用手机浏览器打开：
        <a href="https://parkpulsehk.web.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://parkpulsehk.web.app/</a>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li class="tc"><strong>頂欄</strong>：<span class="kbd">關於</span>、<span class="kbd">設定</span>、<span class="kbd">定位</span>、語系 <span class="kbd">繁</span>／<span class="kbd">简</span>／<span class="kbd">EN</span>，以及 <span class="kbd">切換至桌面版佈局</span>。</li>
        <li class="sc"><strong>顶栏</strong>：<span class="kbd">关于</span>、<span class="kbd">设置</span>、<span class="kbd">定位</span>、语系 <span class="kbd">繁</span>／<span class="kbd">简</span>／<span class="kbd">EN</span>，以及 <span class="kbd">切换至桌面版布局</span>。</li>
        <li class="tc"><strong>底欄</strong>：四個意圖分頁 — <span class="kbd">AUTO 首選</span>、<span class="kbd">EV 充電</span>、<span class="kbd">停車場</span>、<span class="kbd">咪錶</span>；可 <span class="kbd">收起</span>／展開。</li>
        <li class="sc"><strong>底栏</strong>：四个意图分页 — <span class="kbd">AUTO 首选</span>、<span class="kbd">EV 充电</span>、<span class="kbd">停车场</span>、<span class="kbd">咪表</span>；可 <span class="kbd">收起</span>／展开。</li>
        <li class="tc"><strong>桌面版</strong>：需要完整側欄時，撳頂欄 <span class="kbd">切換至桌面版佈局</span>（本教學以手機為主）。</li>
        <li class="sc"><strong>桌面版</strong>：需要完整侧栏时，点顶栏 <span class="kbd">切换至桌面版布局</span>（本教学以手机为主）。</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note tc">狀態列會顯示例如：<strong>2KM 範圍實時: 21 車場 · 88 咪錶</strong>。</p>
      <p class="note sc block">状态栏会显示例如：<strong>2KM 范围实时: 21 车场 · 88 咪表</strong>。</p>
      <figure class="shot tall"><div class="fr"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="01-overview.png" width="440" height="887" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open().document.write('<img src=&quot;'+this.src+'&quot; style=max-width:100%>')"><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:5.8%">1</span><span class="mk" style="left:60.0%;top:5.8%">2</span><span class="mk" style="left:68.0%;top:5.8%">3</span><span class="mk" style="left:78.0%;top:5.8%">4</span><span class="mk" style="left:90.0%;top:5.8%">5</span><span class="mk" style="left:25.0%;top:60.5%">6</span><span class="mk" style="left:94.0%;top:63.5%">7</span><span class="mk" style="left:94.0%;top:70.0%">8</span><span class="mk" style="left:91.0%;top:74.5%">9</span><span class="mk" style="left:13.5%;top:78.5%">10</span><span class="mk" style="left:38.0%;top:78.5%">11</span><span class="mk" style="left:62.0%;top:78.5%">12</span><span class="mk" style="left:86.0%;top:78.5%">13</span></div><ol><li><span class="tc">關於</span><span class="sc">关于</span></li><li><span class="tc">設定</span><span class="sc">设置</span></li><li><span class="tc">定位</span><span class="sc">定位</span></li><li><span class="tc">繁／简／EN</span><span class="sc">繁／简／EN</span></li><li><span class="tc">切換至桌面版佈局</span><span class="sc">切换至桌面版布局</span></li><li><span class="tc">我的 GPS 位置</span><span class="sc">我的 GPS 位置</span></li><li><span class="tc">切換至夜間數碼孿生深色地圖</span><span class="sc">切换至夜间数码孪生深色地图</span></li><li><span class="tc">返回 2KM 中心</span><span class="sc">返回 2KM 中心</span></li><li><span class="tc">收起</span><span class="sc">收起</span></li><li><span class="tc">AUTO 首選</span><span class="sc">AUTO 首选</span></li><li><span class="tc">EV 充電</span><span class="sc">EV 充电</span></li><li><span class="tc">停車場</span><span class="sc">停车场</span></li><li><span class="tc">咪錶</span><span class="sc">咪表</span></li></ol></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="gps">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">02</span>
      <h2 class="tc">定位／我的 GPS 位置</h2>
      <h2 class="sc">定位／我的 GPS 位置</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="tc">地圖上嘅青色標籤 <span class="kbd">我的 GPS 位置</span> 標示目前起點。頂欄 <span class="kbd">定位</span> 可重新對齊。若瀏覽器從未允許定位（或揀咗 Never allow），App 仍可用預設／地圖範圍繼續瀏覽，唔會再強制彈出寬版首次 GPS 面板。</p>
      <p class="sc block">地图上的青色标签 <span class="kbd">我的 GPS 位置</span> 标示当前起点。顶栏 <span class="kbd">定位</span> 可重新对齐。若浏览器从未允许定位（或选了 Never allow），App 仍可用预设／地图范围继续浏览，不会再强制弹出宽版首次 GPS 面板。</p>
      <ul>
        <li class="tc">底欄收起時可撳 <span class="kbd">展開詳細</span> 拉高列表。</li>
        <li class="sc">底栏收起时可点 <span class="kbd">展开详细</span> 拉高列表。</li>
        <li class="tc">右側 FAB：<span class="kbd">切換至夜間數碼孿生深色地圖</span>、<span class="kbd">返回 2KM 中心</span>。</li>
        <li class="sc">右侧 FAB：<span class="kbd">切换至夜间数码孪生深色地图</span>、<span class="kbd">返回 2KM 中心</span>。</li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="shot tall"><div class="fr"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="02-origin-or-gps.png" width="440" height="887" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open().document.write('<img src=&quot;'+this.src+'&quot; style=max-width:100%>')"><span class="mk" style="left:40.0%;top:52.0%">1</span><span class="mk" style="left:68.0%;top:5.8%">2</span><span class="mk" style="left:92.0%;top:85.0%">3</span><span class="mk" style="left:93.0%;top:90.5%">4</span><span class="mk" style="left:88.0%;top:93.0%">5</span><span class="mk" style="left:13.5%;top:97.5%">6</span></div><ol><li><span class="tc">我的 GPS 位置</span><span class="sc">我的 GPS 位置</span></li><li><span class="tc">定位</span><span class="sc">定位</span></li><li><span class="tc">切換至夜間數碼孿生深色地圖</span><span class="sc">切换至夜间数码孪生深色地图</span></li><li><span class="tc">返回 2KM 中心</span><span class="sc">返回 2KM 中心</span></li><li><span class="tc">展開詳細</span><span class="sc">展开详细</span></li><li><span class="tc">AUTO 首選</span><span class="sc">AUTO 首选</span></li></ol></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="tabs">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">03</span>
      <h2 class="tc">底欄意圖分頁</h2>
      <h2 class="sc">底栏意图分页</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="tc">展開底欄後，用四個分頁切換推薦／列表內容：</p>
      <p class="sc block">展开底栏后，用四个分页切换推荐／列表内容：</p>
      <div class="pill-row">
        <span class="pill">AUTO 首選</span>
        <span class="pill tc">EV 充電</span><span class="pill sc">EV 充电</span>
        <span class="pill tc">停車場</span><span class="pill sc">停车场</span>
        <span class="pill tc">咪錶</span><span class="pill sc">咪表</span>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li class="tc">搜尋框：<span class="kbd">搜尋2KM內車位、街道或商場...</span></li>
        <li class="sc">搜索框：<span class="kbd">搜索2KM内车位、街道或商场...</span></li>
        <li class="tc">撳列表卡（例如 <strong>天星停車場</strong>）可喺地圖聚焦並開詳情。</li>
        <li class="sc">点列表卡（例如 <strong>天星停车场</strong>）可在地图聚焦并开详情。</li>
        <li class="tc">需要睇地圖時撳 <span class="kbd">收起</span>。</li>
        <li class="sc">需要看地图时点 <span class="kbd">收起</span>。</li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="shot tall"><div class="fr"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="03-mobile-tabs.png" width="440" height="887" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open().document.write('<img src=&quot;'+this.src+'&quot; style=max-width:100%>')"><span class="mk" style="left:13.5%;top:34.5%">1</span><span class="mk" style="left:38.0%;top:34.5%">2</span><span class="mk" style="left:62.0%;top:34.5%">3</span><span class="mk" style="left:86.0%;top:34.5%">4</span><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:40.0%">5</span><span class="mk" style="left:93.0%;top:30.0%">6</span><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:52.0%">7</span></div><ol><li><span class="tc">AUTO 首選</span><span class="sc">AUTO 首选</span></li><li><span class="tc">EV 充電</span><span class="sc">EV 充电</span></li><li><span class="tc">停車場</span><span class="sc">停车场</span></li><li><span class="tc">咪錶</span><span class="sc">咪表</span></li><li><span class="tc">搜尋2KM內車位、街道或商場...</span><span class="sc">搜索2KM内车位、街道或商场...</span></li><li><span class="tc">收起</span><span class="sc">收起</span></li><li><span class="tc">列表中的車場卡（例如「天星停車場」）</span><span class="sc">列表中的车场卡（例如「天星停车场」）</span></li></ol></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="hud">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">04</span>
      <h2 class="tc">頂欄與地圖 FAB</h2>
      <h2 class="sc">顶栏与地图 FAB</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="tc">手機版<strong>冇</strong>獨立嘅 2D／3D 或圖層 FAB；3D 建築喺 <span class="kbd">設定</span> 入面以 <span class="kbd">3D 建築立體光影</span> 控制（見第 06 節）。地圖右側主要係主題同回中心：</p>
      <p class="sc block">手机版<strong>没有</strong>独立的 2D／3D 或图层 FAB；3D 建筑在 <span class="kbd">设置</span> 里以 <span class="kbd">3D 建筑立体光影</span> 控制（见第 06 节）。地图右侧主要是主题与回中心：</p>
      <ul>
        <li class="tc"><span class="kbd">切換至夜間數碼孿生深色地圖</span> — 日／夜地圖主題。</li>
        <li class="sc"><span class="kbd">切换至夜间数码孪生深色地图</span> — 日／夜地图主题。</li>
        <li class="tc"><span class="kbd">返回 2KM 中心</span> — 地圖拉返 2KM 範圍中心。</li>
        <li class="sc"><span class="kbd">返回 2KM 中心</span> — 地图拉回 2KM 范围中心。</li>
        <li class="tc">頂欄：<span class="kbd">關於</span>、<span class="kbd">設定</span>、<span class="kbd">定位</span>、語系、桌面佈局。</li>
        <li class="sc">顶栏：<span class="kbd">关于</span>、<span class="kbd">设置</span>、<span class="kbd">定位</span>、语系、桌面布局。</li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="shot tall"><div class="fr"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="04-hud-or-fabs.png" width="440" height="887" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open().document.write('<img src=&quot;'+this.src+'&quot; style=max-width:100%>')"><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:5.8%">1</span><span class="mk" style="left:60.0%;top:5.8%">2</span><span class="mk" style="left:68.0%;top:5.8%">3</span><span class="mk" style="left:78.0%;top:5.8%">4</span><span class="mk" style="left:90.0%;top:5.8%">5</span><span class="mk" style="left:92.0%;top:85.0%">6</span><span class="mk" style="left:93.0%;top:90.5%">7</span><span class="mk" style="left:88.0%;top:93.0%">8</span></div><ol><li><span class="tc">關於</span><span class="sc">关于</span></li><li><span class="tc">設定</span><span class="sc">设置</span></li><li><span class="tc">定位</span><span class="sc">定位</span></li><li><span class="tc">繁／简／EN</span><span class="sc">繁／简／EN</span></li><li><span class="tc">切換至桌面版佈局</span><span class="sc">切换至桌面版布局</span></li><li><span class="tc">切換至夜間數碼孿生深色地圖</span><span class="sc">切换至夜间数码孪生深色地图</span></li><li><span class="tc">返回 2KM 中心</span><span class="sc">返回 2KM 中心</span></li><li><span class="tc">展開詳細</span><span class="sc">展开详细</span></li></ol></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="detail">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">05</span>
      <h2 class="tc">點選設施詳情</h2>
      <h2 class="sc">点选设施详情</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="tc">撳地圖上嘅車場柱／標籤，或底欄列表卡，會彈出詳情（例如 <strong>天星停車場</strong>）：空位、收費、DC／AC 槍數。</p>
      <p class="sc block">点地图上的车场柱／标签，或底栏列表卡，会弹出详情（例如 <strong>天星停车场</strong>）：空位、收费、DC／AC 枪数。</p>
      <ul>
        <li class="tc"><strong>導航</strong>：撳卡上嘅導航掣 → <span class="kbd">帶我去 Navigate (Google Maps)</span>。</li>
        <li class="sc"><strong>导航</strong>：点卡上的导航钮 → <span class="kbd">带我去 Navigate (Google Maps)</span>。</li>
        <li class="tc">底欄可再撳 <span class="kbd">展開詳細</span> 睇更多。</li>
        <li class="sc">底栏可再点 <span class="kbd">展开详细</span> 看更多。</li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="shot tall"><div class="fr"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="05-facility-detail.png" width="440" height="887" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open().document.write('<img src=&quot;'+this.src+'&quot; style=max-width:100%>')"><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:42.0%">1</span><span class="mk" style="left:75.0%;top:37.0%">2</span><span class="mk" style="left:82.0%;top:93.5%">3</span><span class="mk" style="left:93.0%;top:66.0%">4</span></div><ol><li><span class="tc">天星停車場 詳情卡</span><span class="sc">天星停车场 详情卡</span></li><li><span class="tc">帶我去 Navigate（Google Maps）</span><span class="sc">带我去 Navigate（Google Maps）</span></li><li><span class="tc">展開詳細</span><span class="sc">展开详细</span></li><li><span class="tc">地圖 FAB／導航快捷</span><span class="sc">地图 FAB／导航快捷</span></li></ol></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="setup">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">06</span>
      <h2 class="tc">設定（系統設定與數據來源）</h2>
      <h2 class="sc">设置（系统设置与数据来源）</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="tc">頂欄撳 <span class="kbd">設定</span> 打開模態視窗。上方篩選：</p>
      <p class="sc block">顶栏点 <span class="kbd">设置</span> 打开模态窗口。上方筛选：</p>
      <div class="pill-row">
        <span class="pill tc">全部設施</span><span class="pill sc">全部设施</span>
        <span class="pill tc">僅顯示有位</span><span class="pill sc">仅显示有位</span>
        <span class="pill tc">智能咪錶 (2,989)</span><span class="pill sc">智能咪表 (2,989)</span>
        <span class="pill">DC 超快充</span>
        <span class="pill tc">無需排隊</span><span class="pill sc">无需排队</span>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li class="tc">數據模式：目前示範為 <span class="kbd">Mode A · DATA.GOV.HK</span> 實時。</li>
        <li class="sc">数据模式：目前演示为 <span class="kbd">Mode A · DATA.GOV.HK</span> 实时。</li>
        <li class="tc">撳 <span class="kbd">完成 Done</span> 關閉；設定即時套用。</li>
        <li class="sc">点 <span class="kbd">完成 Done</span> 关闭；设置即时套用。</li>
        <li class="tc">視窗向下捲仲有：<span class="kbd">立即手動刷新 (Sync Now)</span>、地圖主題，以及 <span class="kbd">3D 建築立體光影</span>（手機版開／關 3D 建築）。</li>
        <li class="sc">窗口向下滚还有：<span class="kbd">立即手动刷新 (Sync Now)</span>、地图主题，以及 <span class="kbd">3D 建筑立体光影</span>（手机版开／关 3D 建筑）。</li>
      </ul>
      <figure class="shot tall"><div class="fr"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="06-setup-modal.png" width="440" height="887" loading="lazy" onclick="window.open().document.write('<img src=&quot;'+this.src+'&quot; style=max-width:100%>')"><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:28.0%">1</span><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:35.0%">2</span><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:42.5%">3</span><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:49.5%">4</span><span class="mk" style="left:50.0%;top:56.5%">5</span><span class="mk" style="left:35.0%;top:74.0%">6</span><span class="mk" style="left:84.5%;top:94.5%">7</span></div><ol><li><span class="tc">全部設施</span><span class="sc">全部设施</span></li><li><span class="tc">僅顯示有位</span><span class="sc">仅显示有位</span></li><li><span class="tc">智能咪錶 (2,989)</span><span class="sc">智能咪表 (2,989)</span></li><li><span class="tc">DC 超快充</span><span class="sc">DC 超快充</span></li><li><span class="tc">無需排隊</span><span class="sc">无需排队</span></li><li><span class="tc">Mode A · DATA.GOV.HK</span><span class="sc">Mode A · DATA.GOV.HK</span></li><li><span class="tc">完成 Done</span><span class="sc">完成 Done</span></li></ol></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

